{"suttaId":"thag20.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[4224,4439],"vripara":"1149"},"segments":{"thag20.1:0.4":"Saṭṭhinipāto","thag20.1:1.1":"Mahāmoggallānattheragāthā “Āraññikā piṇḍapātikā, uñchāpattāgate ratā;","thag20.1:1.3":"Dālemu maccuno senaṃ, ajjhattaṃ susamāhitā.","thag20.1:2.1":"“Āraññikā piṇḍapātikā, uñchāpattāgate ratā;","thag20.1:2.3":"Dhunāma maccuno senaṃ, naḷāgāraṃva kuñjaro.","thag20.1:3.1":"“Rukkhamūlikā sātatikā, uñchāpattāgate ratā;","thag20.1:3.3":"Dālemu maccuno senaṃ, ajjhattaṃ susamāhitā.","thag20.1:4.1":"“Rukkhamūlikā sātatikā, uñchāpattāgate ratā;","thag20.1:4.3":"Dhunāma maccuno senaṃ, naḷāgāraṃva kuñjaro.","thag20.1:5.1":"“Aṭṭhikaṅkalakuṭike, maṃsanhārupasibbite;","thag20.1:5.3":"Dhiratthu pure duggandhe, paragatte mamāyase.","thag20.1:6.1":"“Gūthabhaste taconaddhe, uragaṇḍipisācini;","thag20.1:6.3":"Nava sotāni te kāye, yāni sandanti sabbadā.","thag20.1:7.1":"“Tava sarīraṃ navasotaṃ, duggandhakaraṃ paribandhaṃ;","thag20.1:7.3":"Bhikkhu parivajjayate taṃ, mīḷhaṃ ca yathā sucikāmo.","thag20.1:8.1":"“Evañce taṃ jano jaññā, yathā jānāmi taṃ ahaṃ;","thag20.1:8.3":"Ārakā parivajjeyya, gūthaṭṭhānaṃva pāvuse”.","thag20.1:9.1":"“Evametaṃ mahāvīra, yathā samaṇa bhāsasi;","thag20.1:9.3":"Ettha ceke visīdanti, paṅkamhiva jaraggavo.","thag20.1:10.1":"“Ākāsamhi haliddiyā, yo maññetha rajetave;","thag20.1:10.3":"Aññena vāpi raṅgena, vighātudayameva taṃ.","thag20.1:11.1":"“Tadākāsasamaṃ cittaṃ, ajjhattaṃ susamāhitaṃ;","thag20.1:11.3":"Mā pāpacitte āsādi, aggikhandhaṃva pakkhimā.","thag20.1:12.1":"“Passa cittakataṃ bimbaṃ, arukāyaṃ samussitaṃ;","thag20.1:12.3":"Āturaṃ bahusaṅkappaṃ, yassa natthi dhuvaṃ ṭhiti.","thag20.1:13.1":"“Passa cittakataṃ rūpaṃ, maṇinā kuṇḍalena ca;","thag20.1:13.3":"Aṭṭhiṃ tacena onaddhaṃ, saha vatthehi sobhati.","thag20.1:14.1":"“Alattakakatā pādā, mukhaṃ cuṇṇakamakkhitaṃ;","thag20.1:14.3":"Alaṃ bālassa mohāya, no ca pāragavesino.","thag20.1:15.1":"“Aṭṭhapadakatā kesā, nettā añjanamakkhitā;","thag20.1:15.3":"Alaṃ bālassa mohāya, no ca pāragavesino.","thag20.1:16.1":"“Añjanīva navā cittā, pūtikāyo alaṅkato;","thag20.1:16.3":"Alaṃ bālassa mohāya, no ca pāragavesino.","thag20.1:17.1":"“Odahi migavo pāsaṃ, nāsadā vāguraṃ migo;","thag20.1:17.3":"Bhutvā nivāpaṃ gacchāma, kaddante migabandhake.","thag20.1:18.1":"“Chinno pāso migavassa, nāsadā vāguraṃ migo;","thag20.1:18.3":"Bhutvā nivāpaṃ gacchāma, socante migaluddake.","thag20.1:19.1":"“Tadāsi yaṃ bhiṃsanakaṃ, tadāsi lomahaṃsanaṃ;","thag20.1:19.3":"Anekākārasampanne, sāriputtamhi nibbute.","thag20.1:20.1":"[dī. ni.2.221,272; saṃ. ni.1.186;2.143; apa. thera 1.2.115; jā.1.1.95]“Aniccā vata saṅkhārā uppādavaya dhammino.","thag20.1:20.3":"Upajjitvā nirujjhanti, tesaṃ vūpasamo sukho.","thag20.1:21.1":"“Sukhumaṃ te paṭivijjhanti, vālaggaṃ usunā yathā;","thag20.1:21.3":"Ye pañcakkhandhe passanti, parato no ca attato.","thag20.1:22.1":"“Ye ca passanti saṅkhāre, parato no ca attato;","thag20.1:22.3":"Paccabyādhiṃsu nipuṇaṃ, vālaggaṃ usunā yathā.","thag20.1:23.1":"[saṃ. ni.1.21,97]“Sattiyā viya omaṭṭho, ḍayhamānova matthake;","thag20.1:23.3":"Kāmarāgappahānāya, sato bhikkhu paribbaje.","thag20.1:24.1":"[saṃ. ni.1.21,97]“Sattiyā viya omaṭṭho, ḍayhamānova matthake;","thag20.1:24.3":"Bhavarāgappahānāya, sato bhikkhu paribbaje”.","thag20.1:25.1":"“Codito bhāvitattena, sarīrantimadhārinā;","thag20.1:25.3":"Migāramātupāsādaṃ, pādaṅguṭṭhena kampayiṃ.","thag20.1:26.1":"“Nayidaṃ sithilamārabbha, nayidaṃ appena thāmasā;","thag20.1:26.3":"Nibbānamadhigantabbaṃ, sabbagantha-pamocanaṃ.","thag20.1:27.1":"“Ayañca daharo bhikkhu, ayamuttamaporiso;","thag20.1:27.3":"Dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jetvā māraṃ savāhiniṃ [savāhanaṃ (ka.)].","thag20.1:28.1":"“Vivaramanupabhanti vijjutā, vebhārassa ca paṇḍavassa ca;","thag20.1:28.3":"Nagavivaragato jhāyati, putto appaṭimassa tādino.","thag20.1:29.1":"“Upasanto uparato, pantasenāsano muni;","thag20.1:29.3":"Dāyādo buddhaseṭṭhassa, brahmunā abhivandito.","thag20.1:30.1":"“Upasantaṃ uparataṃ, pantasenāsanaṃ muniṃ;","thag20.1:30.3":"Dāyādaṃ buddhaseṭṭhassa, vanda brāhmaṇa kassapaṃ.","thag20.1:31.1":"“Yo ca jātisataṃ gacche, sabbā brāhmaṇajātiyo;","thag20.1:31.3":"Sottiyo vedasampanno, manussesu punappunaṃ.","thag20.1:32.1":"“Ajjhāyakopi ce assa, tiṇṇaṃ vedāna pāragū;","thag20.1:32.3":"Etassa vandanāyetaṃ, kalaṃ nāgghati soḷasiṃ.","thag20.1:33.1":"“Yo so aṭṭha vimokkhāni, purebhattaṃ aphassayi [apassayi (sī. ka.), aphussayi (syā.)];","thag20.1:33.3":"Anulomaṃ paṭilomaṃ, tato piṇḍāya gacchati.","thag20.1:34.1":"“Tādisaṃ bhikkhuṃ māsādi [mā hani (sī.)], māttānaṃ khaṇi brāhmaṇa;","thag20.1:34.3":"Abhippasādehi manaṃ, arahantamhi tādine;","thag20.1:34.5":"Khippaṃ pañjaliko vanda, mā te vijaṭi matthakaṃ.","thag20.1:35.1":"“Neso passati saddhammaṃ, saṃsārena purakkhato;","thag20.1:35.3":"Adhogamaṃ jimhapathaṃ, kummaggamanudhāvati.","thag20.1:36.1":"“Kimīva mīḷhasallitto, saṅkhāre adhimucchito;","thag20.1:36.3":"Pagāḷho lābhasakkāre, tuccho gacchati poṭṭhilo.","thag20.1:37.1":"“Imañca passa āyantaṃ, sāriputtaṃ sudassanaṃ;","thag20.1:37.3":"Vimuttaṃ ubhatobhāge, ajjhattaṃ susamāhitaṃ.","thag20.1:38.1":"“Visallaṃ khīṇasaṃyogaṃ, tevijjaṃ maccuhāyinaṃ;","thag20.1:38.3":"Dakkhiṇeyyaṃ manussānaṃ, puññakkhettaṃ anuttaraṃ.","thag20.1:39.1":"“Ete sambahulā devā, iddhimanto yasassino;","thag20.1:39.3":"Dasa devasahassāni, sabbe brahmapurohitā;","thag20.1:39.5":"Moggallānaṃ namassantā, tiṭṭhanti pañjalīkatā.","thag20.1:40.1":"“‘Namo te purisājañña, namo te purisuttama;","thag20.1:40.3":"Yassa te āsavā khīṇā, dakkhiṇeyyosi mārisa’.","thag20.1:41.1":"“Pūjito naradevena, uppanno maraṇābhibhū;","thag20.1:41.3":"Puṇḍarīkaṃva toyena, saṅkhārenupalippati.","thag20.1:42.1":"“Yassa muhuttena sahassadhā loko, saṃvidito sabrahmakappo vasi;","thag20.1:42.3":"Iddhiguṇe cutupapāte kāle, passati devatā sa bhikkhu.","thag20.1:43.1":"“Sāriputtova paññāya, sīlena upasamena ca;","thag20.1:43.3":"Yopi pāraṅgato bhikkhu, etāvaparamo siyā.","thag20.1:44.1":"“Koṭisatasahassassa, attabhāvaṃ khaṇena nimmine;","thag20.1:44.3":"Ahaṃ vikubbanāsu kusalo, vasībhūtomhi iddhiyā.","thag20.1:45.1":"“Samādhivijjāvasipāramīgato, moggallānagotto asitassa sāsane;","thag20.1:45.3":"Dhīro samucchindi samāhitindriyo, nāgo yathā pūtilataṃva bandhanaṃ.","thag20.1:46.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thag20.1:46.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thag20.1:47.1":"“Yassa catthāya pabbajito, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thag20.1:47.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thag20.1:48.1":"[ma. ni.1.513]“Kīdiso nirayo āsi, yattha dussī apaccatha;","thag20.1:48.3":"Vidhuraṃ sāvakamāsajja, kakusandhañca brāhmaṇaṃ.","thag20.1:49.1":"“Sataṃ āsi ayosaṅkū, sabbe paccattavedanā;","thag20.1:49.3":"Īdiso nirayo āsi, yattha dussī apaccatha;","thag20.1:49.5":"Vidhuraṃ sāvakamāsajja, kakusandhañca brāhmaṇaṃ.","thag20.1:50.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti, bhikkhu buddhassa sāvako;","thag20.1:50.3":"Tādisaṃ bhikkhumāsajja, kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:51.1":"“Majjhesarasmiṃ [sarassa (sī.), sāgarasmiṃ (ka.)] tiṭṭhanti, vimānā kappaṭhāyino;","thag20.1:51.3":"Veḷuriyavaṇṇā rucirā, accimanto pabhassarā;","thag20.1:51.5":"Accharā tattha naccanti, puthu nānattavaṇṇiyo.","thag20.1:52.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti … pe … kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:53.1":"“Yo ve buddhena codito, bhikkhusaṅghassa pekkhato;","thag20.1:53.3":"Migāramātupāsādaṃ, pādaṅguṭṭhena kampayi.","thag20.1:54.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti … pe … kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:55.1":"“Yo vejayantapāsādaṃ, pādaṅguṭṭhena kampayi;","thag20.1:55.3":"Iddhibalenupatthaddho, saṃvejesi ca devatā.","thag20.1:56.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti … pe … kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:57.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti … pe … kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi. “Yo vejayantapāsāde, sakkaṃ so paripucchati;","thag20.1:57.3":"Api āvuso jānāsi, taṇhakkhayavimuttiyo;","thag20.1:57.5":"Tassa sakko viyākāsi, pañhaṃ puṭṭho yathātathaṃ.","thag20.1:58.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti … pe … kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:59.1":"“Yo brahmānaṃ paripucchati, sudhammāyaṃ ṭhito [sudhammāyā’ bhito (syā.)] sabhaṃ;","thag20.1:59.3":"Ajjāpi tyāvuso sā diṭṭhi, yā te diṭṭhi pure ahu;","thag20.1:59.5":"Passasi vītivattantaṃ, brahmaloke pabhassaraṃ.","thag20.1:60.1":"“Tassa brahmā viyākāsi, pañhaṃ puṭṭho yathātathaṃ;","thag20.1:60.3":"Na me mārisa sā diṭṭhi, yā me diṭṭhi pure ahu.","thag20.1:61.1":"“Passāmi vītivattantaṃ, brahmaloke pabhassaraṃ;","thag20.1:61.3":"Sohaṃ ajja kathaṃ vajjaṃ, ahaṃ niccomhi sassato.","thag20.1:62.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti … pe … kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:63.1":"“Yo mahāneruno kūṭaṃ, vimokkhena aphassayi [apassayi (sī. ka.)];","thag20.1:63.3":"Vanaṃ pubbavidehānaṃ, ye ca bhūmisayā narā.","thag20.1:64.1":"“Yo etamabhijānāti, bhikkhu buddhassa sāvako;","thag20.1:64.3":"Tādisaṃ bhikkhumāsajja, kaṇha dukkhaṃ nigacchasi.","thag20.1:65.1":"“Na ve aggi cetayati, ahaṃ bālaṃ ḍahāmīti;","thag20.1:65.3":"Bālova jalitaṃ aggiṃ, āsajja naṃ paḍayhati.","thag20.1:66.1":"“Evameva tuvaṃ māra, āsajja naṃ tathāgataṃ;","thag20.1:66.3":"Sayaṃ ḍahissasi attānaṃ, bālo aggiṃva samphusaṃ.","thag20.1:67.1":"“Apuññaṃ pasavī māro, āsajja naṃ tathāgataṃ;","thag20.1:67.3":"Kiṃ nu maññasi pāpima, na me pāpaṃ vipaccati.","thag20.1:68.1":"“Karato te cīyate [miyyate (sabbattha) ma. ni.1.513 passitabbaṃ] pāpaṃ, cirarattāya antaka;","thag20.1:68.3":"Māra nibbinda buddhamhā, āsaṃ mākāsi bhikkhusu.","thag20.1:69.1":"“Iti māraṃ atajjesi, bhikkhu bhesakaḷāvane;","thag20.1:69.3":"Tato so dummano yakkho, tatthevantaradhāyathā”ti.","thag20.1:69.5":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mahāmoggallāno [mahāmoggalāno (ka.)] thero gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thag20.1:69.6":"Saṭṭhinipāto niṭṭhito.","thag20.1:70.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag20.1:70.1":"Saṭṭhikamhi nipātamhi, moggallāno mahiddhiko;","thag20.1:70.3":"Ekova theragāthāyo, aṭṭhasaṭṭhi bhavanti tāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
